	(text "STM32H563ZIT6. DFU: blank flash boots ROM bootloader; in-field: firmware jump-to-bootloader; fallback: bridge TP2 (BOOT0) to TP4 (3V3), reset via TP1 (NRST) to TP3 (GND)."
